temFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">智谱开源原生多模态大模型GLM-5.3-Flash，推理成本降至Opus 4.8的四十分之一</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亚马逊未来两年将向英伟达追订200万颗GPU用于数据中心建设</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic与Nscale达成450亿美元算力租赁协议，2027年启用Vera Rubin芯片</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里千问发布多模态MoE模型Qwen3.8-Flash并开源Qwen3.8-Flash-Next架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b7a76b022cee731aea285ed0769c98ee.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里千问团队正式发布多模态MoE模型Qwen3.8-Flash，并同步开源下一代底层架构Qwen3.8-Flash-Next。Qwen3.8-Flash总参数量125B，搭载51B N-gram Embedding，每token仅激活6B参数。模型原生支持26万token上下文，通过YaRN技术可扩展至100万token。架构层面，该模型采用GDN+QSA混合注意力架构，在百万token场景下，Prefill与Decode速度分别提升7.6倍与4.9倍；引入Gated Residual机制优化残差流，并采用Muon与AdamW混合优化策略。在成本方面，其训练开销仅为Qwen3.7-Plus的九分之一，API定价为每百万Tokens输入1元、输出3元。性能上，该模型在SWE-bench Pro中取得62.5分，并</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达拟以超130亿美元收购开源AI平台Hugging Face</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/487f01ecf26ff4a9ed5d66135ddfcafc.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正与开源AI平台Hugging Face深度洽谈收购事宜，拟定估值超过130亿美元。此前微软也曾与Hugging Face进行初步接触，但未进入深入谈判阶段。Hugging Face作为AI领域的“GitHub”，目前托管着数百万个模型与数据集。在商业化表现上，其年化营收已突破1.5亿美元，较2024年的1.3亿美元实现显著增长，付费转化率维持在3%至5%之间，拥有超2000家企业客户。去年年底，Hugging Face曾因担忧主导型投资者干预决策，拒绝了英伟达5亿美元的投资。若此次并购达成，将成为英伟达历史上规模最大的并购案之一。此举旨在强化英伟达的开发者生态与硬件绑定，但同时也引发了行业对其平台中立性的担忧，并可能重塑与AMD、英特尔等芯片厂商的竞争格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱开源原生多模态大模型GLM-5.3-Flash，推理成本降至Opus 4.8的四十分之一</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/39fce04f4420981a50b07e9e068169e1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智谱正式开源GLM-5系列首款原生多模态模型GLM-5.3-Flash（320B-A18B）。该模型在Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index测评中获57分，性能与Claude Opus 4.8持平。其核心优势在于极致定价，限时折扣后成本仅为Opus 4.8的四十分之一。技术上，该模型采用稀疏与线性注意力混合架构，并引入流形约束超连接技术，使注意力计算量下降3.01倍，KV缓存缩减4.44倍。模型原生融合视觉能力，支持前端开发、3D建模及专业文档处理。值得注意的是，该模型全量流量由国产芯片集群承载，依托自研推理引擎与EPD分离架构，端到端推理性能提升3倍，硬件效率比肩英伟达主流GPU。目前，GLM-5.3-Flash已开放API接口、在线体验及ZCode、AutoClaw等A</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亚马逊未来两年将向英伟达追订200万颗GPU用于数据中心建设</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a2056d720736f193e77870812afce2a7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亚马逊与英伟达于8月26日宣布深化合作，亚马逊计划在未来两年内为AWS数据中心新增部署200万颗英伟达GPU，涵盖Blackwell Ultra、Rubin及Rubin Ultra系列芯片，主要用于大模型训练与推理，预计于2027至2028年陆续交付。此次订单规模较五个月前承诺的100万颗翻倍，显示出大模型算力需求激增。尽管亚马逊持续推进Trainium与Graviton自研芯片以降低成本，但英伟达在高性能算力领域的主导地位依然稳固。除硬件采购外，双方合作扩展至网络、开放模型、CPU及机器人平台，亚马逊将引入Omniverse、Cosmos与Isaac等“物理AI”技术栈优化仓储自动化。英伟达二季度财报显示数据中心营收达890亿美元，同比增长117%，并确认Rubin架构已进入量产阶段，公司正通过大规模基建投入</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic与Nscale达成450亿美元算力租赁协议，2027年启用Vera Rubin芯片</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2a627f1031df4e9dd21aced6d200b734.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic已与英国AI基础设施公司Nscale签署价值约450亿美元的算力租赁协议，合作期限长达6年。该批算力资源将由Nscale位于美国西弗吉尼亚州的旗舰数据中心提供，预计于2027年底正式启用。此次合作的核心在于部署英伟达最新一代Vera Rubin芯片系统，该系统由六款不同芯片协同工作，是Anthropic支撑下一代模型研发的关键底座。这是Anthropic近期大规模扩充算力储备的最新动作，此前其已先后与Volta、AMD、SpaceX、亚马逊及谷歌等达成多项算力合作。随着AI竞赛从模型能力比拼转向基础设施军备赛，Anthropic通过锁定Vera Rubin产能，旨在确保其在下一轮技术跃迁中的竞争优势。此举反映了头部AI厂商为应对模型训练需求，正加速在全球范围内囤积高性能计算资源。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
